This product bundles a snapshot of kanon (https://github.com/politeuma/kanon)
under src/daimonion/kanon/: sections/MANIFEST.yml and the section files it
lists. The exact kanon commit is recorded in src/daimonion/kanon/KANON_SHA.
kanon is Copyright 2026 politeuma Contributors and is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The bundled section prose is redistributed
unmodified; `daimonion agents-md` copies it into a project's agent guide
(AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md) between the daimonion:ethics markers, and that copied
text remains kanon content under the same license.

The kanon sections summarise laws, standards, and court decisions for
engineering guidance. They are not legal advice.
